      "title": "Describing Properties of the Tangent Function"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "28385275-905f-51fb-b90e-2833d037072d",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ represents any integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $\\tan (x+\\pi )=\\tan (x+2n\\pi ).$\n- **II.** The function has asymptotes at $x=n\\pi $\n- **III.** $\\tan (x-\\frac{\\pi }{4})=\\tan (x+\\frac{3\\pi }{4}).$\n\nIn tangent equalities, consider values of $x$ where both sides are defined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "8ce19e7f-ae78-506a-a2d1-8101d49d622b",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "89dc85b5-722a-5aaa-a257-f53a5646dc2d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "165c4409-871b-534e-a214-e8fd00985bbe",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "165c4409-871b-534e-a214-e8fd00985bbe"
          ]
        },
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "6ef42424-1d6e-5f65-b45d-5831bd24ee0e",
          ":answer-field/key": "II",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "f376a8db-d415-5177-8af1-a52e6530533e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "bc6fd500-a202-5fe3-a624-f2236aebfc22",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "f376a8db-d415-5177-8af1-a52e6530533e"
          ]
        },
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "02682781-ead8-53ab-bc3b-11e9b8c69f56",
          ":answer-field/key": "III",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "7fec59c5-c224-5e7c-a125-e4f05e936309",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "3cf16653-c5dc-53b1-8e78-b5a438d3bdce",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
