      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\tan x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186176049/tangent.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true. The asymptotes occur at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi.$\n\n- Statement II is false. The range is $(-\\infty,\\infty).$\n\n- Statement III is false. The domain excludes $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi.$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I only\"."
    },
