    "question": {
      ":question/id": "da5d10ce-4565-5180-8edf-818e553a6481",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ represents any integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $\\tan(x+\\pi)=\\tan(x+2n\\pi).$\n- **II.** $\\tan(x- \\frac{\\pi}{2})=\\tan(x).$\n- **III.** The domain is all real numbers.\n\nIn tangent equalities, consider values of $x$ where both sides are defined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "06508d11-ee9e-5316-b605-6658345aa4ee",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "fb3c3c07-439e-5478-8866-f5affe62966c",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "2499df73-b642-5a42-8a4a-b91724fdba36",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "2499df73-b642-5a42-8a4a-b91724fdba36"
          ]
        },
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "8c613118-fe58-5d15-b1ca-a35a19a696df",
          ":answer-field/key": "II",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "0e17a892-90e3-5c7c-a520-66621c3b9607",
